            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.57

- Meeting summaries now preserve explicit commitments and requested tasks in Next steps, even when Apple Intelligence incorrectly says none were stated.
- Includes the separate Meetings library, one-click private meeting summaries, and bounded routine dictation history introduced in 0.6.56.
]]></description>
